message:
fix a bug introduced by the last optimization

before this fix, the relevant code is 

        real vx1; 
        real vy1; 
        real vz1;
        if (!cal_p)
        {
           real  vx1 = LDG(g_vx, n1); 
           real  vy1 = LDG(g_vy, n1); 
           real  vz1 = LDG(g_vz, n1);
        }

This means that the velocities are local to this (template) if statement
and the velocities used in later heat current calculations are zero!


To correct this, just change it to
        real vx1; 
        real vy1; 
        real vz1;
        if (!cal_p)
        {
            vx1 = LDG(g_vx, n1); 
            vy1 = LDG(g_vy, n1); 
            vz1 = LDG(g_vz, n1);
        }
